                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerubi enga yi ma opile, tu uru nyaku driasi, yini furia ma ndre ra, pa omberu ’diyi ovu yi ma ejelea indi; yi mu pa so jo Yehovani ma kalitile etuni efuzurialeruri ma tilia ogogo; te diza Mungu Israelinirini ovu yi ma drilia uru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
